  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is the provision of a more       accountable, democratic and efficient local governance in Bosnia and  Herzegovina. The project purpose is to improve the ability of         municipalities to serve their male and female citizens and to support a policy and fiscal framework which is conducive to accountable and   democratic governance.</narrative>
